ier, the American team, had to win two tie-breaker games to reach the medal games. The two semi-finals were contrasting; Canada took an early lead against the USA and pulled away for an easy 7-1 victory whilst the Switzerland-Norway match came down to the final end where the game was decided by a single point to the Swiss."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Comfortably expected to win the gold medal, the Canadian then had an unmitigated disaster in the final and trailed 9-1 after six of the ten ends. Although " [:a {:href "/athletes/100312"} "Mike Harris"] "’s Canadian team pulled back two shots to only lose 9-3, " [:a {:href "/athletes/100338"} "Patrick Hürlimann"] "’s Lausanne club rink were crowned Olympic champions. Norway added to North American disappointment by defeating the USA for bronze."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Wins"] [:th {} "Losses"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Percentage"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-16551"} [:div {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-plus"}]] [:td {} "1"] [:td {} "Switzerland"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SUI"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SUI.png"}] "SUI"]] [:td {} "7"] [:td {} "2"] [:td {} "14"] [:td {} "61-38"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-16551 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} "Skip"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/100338"} "Patrick Hürlimann"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–-–"] [:td {} "75%"] [:td {}] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class " accordion-body team-members-16551 collapse", :style ""} [:td {}] [:td {} "Third"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/100339"} "Patrik Lörtscher"] " "] [:td {}] [:td {} "–"]